For next weekend's Lojban-only vocal meeting, I suggest Sunday 15 of 
February, beginning at 1:30PM UTC on Skype.
It will last at least until 5PM UTC (possibly longer, as long as people 
are there and willing to continue), so that jbopre from Western US can 
take part as well.

The meeting will take place in the "jbobau vokta'a kumfa" group on 
Skype; if you aren't already member of this group, please contact me or 
Gleki via Skype (my Skype name is "ilmen-vodhr"), and we'll add you to 
the group.

If there occur sounds problems during the Skype call as it happened two 
weeks ago, we'll switch to using the Mumble 
<http://mw.lojban.org/lmw/Mumble> Metal Bunker server instead of Skype.

If you're willing to chat vocally in Lojban but this time interval is 
not suitable for you, please feel free to propose another session (you 
can also check whether there's somebody attending the Metal Bunker 
server on Mumble).

mi'e la .ilmen. mu'o


